ford Hot Springs","legend":"A geothermal springs with naturally heated water that provide relaxation and medicinal benefits. Average temperature is 86°F."},{"id":"marker1","name":"Dunswest Creek of Luck","legend":"This legendary water source is whispered about in ancient tales and believed to possess mystical properties. The spring emanates crystal-clear water, shimmering with an otherworldly iridescence that sparkles even in the dimmest light."},{"id":"marker2","name":"Totford — copper mining town","legend":"Totford is a mining town of 6602 people just nearby the copper mine."},{"id":"marker3","name":"Dodbrighes — gold mining town","legend":"Dodbrighes is a mining town of 11040 people just nearby the gold mine."},{"id":"marker4","name":"Towcesbury Bridge","legend":"A stone bridge spans over the Tretondon River near Towcesbury."},{"id":"marker5","name":"The New Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious cured cabbage with green sap is served here."},{"id":"marker6","name":"Yeolivean Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker7","name":"Southambean Waterfall","legend":"An impressive waterfall has cut through the land."},{"id":"marker8","name":"Westley Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Soutlian Intervention. \r\nDate: May 4, 1883 Causbury Era."},{"id":"marker9","name":"Wargford Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Hornish Rebellion. \r\nDate: January 7, 1851 Causbury Era."},{"id":"marker10","name":"Wargham Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Soutlian Intervention. \r\nDate: November 6, 1884 Causbury Era."},{"id":"marker11","name":"Stanster Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Linsian War. \r\nDate: August 18, 1911 Causbury Era."},{"id":"marker12","name":"Mitbury Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Tretonese Conquest. \r\nDate: March 30, 1801 Causbury Era."},{"id":"marker13","name":"Calingham Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Linsian War. \r\nDate: April 6, 1907 Causbury Era."},{"id":"marker14","name":"Bingraring Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Hornish Campaign. \r\nDate: May 6, 1771 Causbury Era."},{"id":"marker15","name":"Reasalworth Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Hornish Campaign. \r\nDate: October 18, 1769 Causbury Era."},{"id":"marker16","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=rph9334\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=rph9334\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker17","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=rph3148\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=rph3148\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker18","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=rph3547\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=rph3547\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker19","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=rph9328\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=rph9328\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker20","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=rph4023\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://wata