 fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker27","name":"Axble Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 35 ft long."},{"id":"marker28","name":"Felworth Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 23 ft long."},{"id":"marker29","name":"Bromyard Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 22 ft long."},{"id":"marker30","name":"Darlowbig Giant","legend":"Tales speak of a horrifying Giant who inhabits Darlowbig hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker31","name":"Dodbrighton Warg","legend":"Locals speak of a feared Warg who inhabits Dodbrighton hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker32","name":"Pilboreven Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Faith of Atonmouth."},{"id":"marker33","name":"Louthbury Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Word of Bington."},{"id":"marker34","name":"Causdon Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Old Padster Shamanism."},{"id":"marker35","name":"Pendoverton Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Faith of Atonmouth."},{"id":"marker36","name":"Searalisho Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Kindoningtism."},{"id":"marker37","name":"Newbumeton Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Westlism."},{"id":"marker38","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker39","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker40","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker41","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker42","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker43","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker44","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker45","name":"Marlme Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳲⳜⳈⲶⳆⳬⳐⳬ⳹ⳬⳁⳈⳌⳘ ⳂⳚⳂ⳩ⳀⲸⳫⳞⳤ⳹ⳤⳈⳠ⳪⳥ⲸⳖⳚ⳹Ⳬ⳪ⳒⳆⳞ⳾ⲼⳫⲶⳎⳠ ⳠⳀⳄⳈⲶⳒⲶⳆⲴ ⳧ⳤⳠⳆⲸⲴⲾⳌ</div>"},{"id":"marker46","name":"Madingham Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲲⲼⳊⳁⲶⳖⳁⳃⳃⳬⳫⲴ⳹ⲼⳊⳃⲸⳐ⳥Ⳅ⳧ ⲲⲲⳢⳂⳂ ⳖⳜⳔ ⳄⳊⳄⲾⳞ ⳹ⲼⳫⳆⳐ⳩ⲲⳒⳔⲲⳊⳂⳃⳠⳎⳜ⳧ⳃⳐ Ⳛ ⳀⳀⲺⳲ⳾ⳖⳲ ⳥ⳄⳂⳜⳞⳞⳲⳞⳠⳂⳠ⳥⳪ⳄⲾⳤⳭⳫ ⳠⳚⳂⳀⳚⳬ</div>"},{"id":"marker47","name":"Dodbrid Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༺༙༫༳༷ༀ༪༯༡༮༢༁༷༿༤༚༁༼༠༅ༀ༙༼༐༩༗༐༢༫༥༶༡༌༁༜༨༶༻༸༪་༣༜༿༊༪༷༯༹༖༕༂༪༅༂༢༛༻༤༆༹༚༾༤༳༬༜༇༂༐༛༦༐༥༣༗༉༭་༁༅༘༇༿༐༩༱༪༄༭ༀༀ༌༘</div>"},{"id":"marker48","name":"Seasalcesto Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༙༐༢༨༴༧༣༫༢༈༻༑༔༁༩༭༃༶༃༱༔༇༷༄༤༪༕༉༄་༰་༶༤༑༺༌༹༩༾༪༿༮༢༪༡༳༖༚༮༗༱༶༂ༀ༰༅༶་༤༤༒༾༌༸༼༢ༀ༳༌༔༰༘༫༹༊༐༑</div>"},{"id":"marker49","name":"Chichfield Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc26\udc08\udc0c\ud802\ud802 𐠞\udc3c𐠯\udc13\udc34𐠨\udc12\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠿 \udc22𐠚𐠐\udc0c𐠄𐠿\udc11\udc1f\udc2c\udc2b𐠣\udc22𐠤\udc0e\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠧\udc38𐠔𐠩𐠯\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc0a\ud802\ud802𐠓𐠣\udc02𐠵\udc18\udc35\udc02\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker50","name":"Hatbury Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢜᡜᡯᠲᠰᠻᡴᠳᡁᡖᡓ᠐ᡏᢞᢒ᠀ᡠ᠐ᢥᡰᢁᡒᠩᢡᢒ᠑ᡍᢋᢁᠻᡴᠻᡓ᠀ᡆᢠᡞᡯᡕᢂᠰᡖᡯᡱᢛᡗᢒᢀᡖᡔᠧᡭᡭᠩ᠑ᢠᠳᢑᠾᢂᢂᢋᠯᠧᠯᡯᡳᡡᡁᡑᢜᠻᢢᡆᢁᠮᢋᡑᢐᡟᡮᠼ᠑ᠰᡁᡀᢜᢥᡖ᠀ᡱ᠀ᡏ</div>"},{"id":"marker51","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker52","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker53","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker54","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Thethambe Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Travelling Wonderous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wonderous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Travelling Wonderous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wonderous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Childon Melee","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of brutality in Childon, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Merton Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Merton, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Marshesbury River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Cats migration","legend":"A huge group of cats are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Felseasalme ball","legen